<div class=default_9 align=justify>
Signing up for this great advertising opportunity is quick and easy. But you should have the following pieces of information included with your initial email:
<br>
<ul>
<li><strong>Your Company Information</strong><br>
Please provide us with the name of the company this campaign is being set up for and the address and contact information. We do <strong>NOT</strong> allow any Cheat Guide sites to participate in this new program.
<br><br></li>
<li><strong>Amount Being Spent for the Campaign</strong><br>
Please provide us with the total amount you will be spending for the campaign.
<br><br></li>

<li><strong>Sites that this Campaign will Target</strong><br>
Please just list off the site or sites that you wish this particular campaign to target.
<br><br></li>

<li><strong>Amount You are Bidding to Pay Per Click</strong><br>
This is the amount that you want too pay each time somebody visits your site via our banner system. The lowest amount that can be spent is $0.10 per click. The more you spend per click the more chances your campaign will have to be seen by the site visitors. This allows you to decide how much exposure you want. If this is your first time using a weighted bidding system for advertising, you should bid a low amount and work your way up every few campaigns till you find a comfortable level.

<br><br></li>
<li><strong>Banners to be Used in this Campaign</strong><br>
Attach at least 1 banner to be used for the campaign. If you choose to use multiple banners please attach each of them. Banners should be 728 x 90.
<br><br></li>

</ul>

<br>
To contact us please include the above information and send an email to <a href="mailto:advertise@ascensionweb.com ">Advertise@Ascensionweb.com</a>. Once your email has been received we will follow up to go over payment arrangements as all campaigns must be paid for in advance via check, money order or PayPal. You can also contact us directly via phone at 315.383.8146.



